 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B2?= <iadmin@aviales.local>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:35:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Android: Add Ladybird engine integration (JNI bridge +
 native ViewImplementation stubs)

- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/LadybirdEngine.cpp: Native WebView creation, initialization, and navigation stubs for LibWeb/LibJS rendering
- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt: LADYBIRD_LINK_ENGINE option to link full AK/LibCore/LibWeb; defaults OFF for bootstrap
- UI/Android/app/src/main/java/org/ladybird/androidport/NativeBridge.kt: JNI wrapper (nativeInit, nativeCreateWebView, nativeLoadURL, nativeDestroyWebView)
- UI/Android/app/src/main/java/org/ladybird/androidport/MainActivity.kt: Material 3 Compose UI converted to Kotlin, calls nativeInit() on startup
- Removed old .java stubs (MainActivity.java, NativeBridge.java); Kotlin versions replace them
- Bootstrap APK builds and runs; engine init returns false until LibWeb is linked

Next: Wire nativeCreateWebView to ANativeWindow + WebView::ViewImplementation after vcpkg manifest completes
